    perf_specs_blocked_no_self_hosted_binary_and_unregistered_font_fixture_2026-08-18, 902, "2026-11-03 perf-triage-13: open, environment-blocked. test/05_perf/stress/multicore_green_fanout_spec.spl:215,225 still assert empty stderr, which needs a deployed self-hosted binary. test/05_perf/graphics_2d/simple_2d_vector_fonts_perf_spec.spl:112 still calls engine.load_font(path) on an unregistered fixture and :83,:89 still need host-pinned SIMPLE_2D_BITMAP_BASELINE_* values. Fixability: BIG/needs-stage3 for the fanout spec and baselines; the font load alone is a small spec edit to load_font_bytes but would not turn the spec green."
    perf_specs_blocked_no_self_hosted_binary_and_unregistered_font_fixture_2026-08-18, 903, "2026-11-13: Blocked on this host: multicore_green_fanout_spec asserts empty stderr, which needs a self-hosted binary (the seed banner cannot be suppressed through its env -i probe), and the vector-font spec needs host-pinned baselines. The font-fixture half is fixed (1fc1852855a). Regression found, not repaired here: transplant 88aac2ffe28 undid cbe6b94a79f in multicore_green_fanout_spec.spl (mkdir -p build/tmp in unique_probe_path; bin/simple fallback in simple_binary), so probes now fail with 98/127 before reaching the stderr assertion; origin/main carries the same reverted text."
    perf_specs_blocked_no_self_hosted_binary_and_unregistered_font_fixture_2026-08-18, 904, "2026-11-13: Probe regression repaired: cbe6b94a79f re-applied to test/05_perf/stress/multicore_green_fanout_spec.spl (mkdir -p build/tmp; bin/simple fallback). On release/1.0.0 5221a5058a8, Linux aarch64 (DGX Spark GB10), Rust seed af717f53d6bce3e5: before, 3 examples 2 failed with the harness sentinel (expected probe_write_failed, 98); after, with SIMPLE_BIN set to the seed, the probes run and the same 2 examples fail only on the empty-stderr assertion (seed banner). Row stays open on the self-hosted-binary blocker. origin/main still carries the reverted text and needs the same change."

